  "engineering_status": "v0.1 STARTER \u2014 manual curation incomplete. Provides operational baseline for Path B engine wiring but additional taxonomy work required (estimated 40+ unmapped atlas cells need manual review, ~70 matrix columns need atlas-cell-contributor lists). The unmapped lists are the explicit TODO for v0.2.",
  "matching_protocol": {
    "pooled_matrix_columns": "When matrix column receives contributions from multiple atlas cells (e.g., B_cells \u2190 {B, B-cells_EPIC, Bnv, Bmem, Bcell}), compute matrix-cell A-score as the mean of contributing atlas-cell A-scores.",
    "tissue_of_origin_matrix_columns": "Tissue-of-origin matrix columns (breast_LE, breast_BE, pancreatic_beta_cells, etc.) map 1:1 to atlas cells of the same name when found, else unmapped.",
    "compute_match_magnitude_protocol": "For each populated matrix row (disease \u00d7 phase): (1) extract expected_d vector indexed by matrix columns; (2) use this mapping artifact to translate patient 115-cell A-score vector \u2192 123-cell matrix-column-space vector; (3) compute Mahalanobis-style sign-aligned weighted product (NOT raw dot product) weighted by \u221an_contributors per matrix column; (4) return per-row match_magnitude + per-cell contribution decomposition."
  }
